              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2190,
                "end_index": 2360,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Anxiety and Insomnia:** In rare cases of massive doses (such as daily high-dose injections), patients have reported feeling jittery, anxious, or having trouble sleeping"
