              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2368,
                "end_index": 2595,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "### When High Blood Levels of B12 are Concerning\nIf a routine blood test shows that your B12 levels are unusually high (typically **over 900 to 1,000 pg/mL**), the clinical interpretation depends entirely on *why* they are high"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
